   711                                  ; recover -- bring back a card that an earlier run left mid-transfer: a
   712                                  ; card part way through sending a block ignores CMD0 until the block is
   713                                  ; out.  So, selected, clock out more than a block and its CRC; send CMD12,
   714                                  ; which ends a multiple-block read; then deselect.  v3, v5 and v7 each
   715                                  ; began after a run that had stopped part way, and each saw no answer to
   716                                  ; CMD0 until the card was taken out and put back.
