  1465                                  ; rd_xact -- data command AL, argument EBX: CX bytes of data, then its two
  1466                                  ; CRC16 bytes, to DI.  AL = R1 (FFh if none).  CF on failure, [why] saying
  1467                                  ; which.  Tried again, up to three times, if the block was not kept whole.
